UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerDanielIntro::
	.string "Whoa! What a surprise!\n"
	.string "I didn’t expect to see anyone here!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerDanielDefeat::
	.string "Whoa! I’m beaten big time!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerDaniel::
	.string "I was conned into buying a SLOWPOKE-\n"
	.string "TAIL.\p"
	.string "I feel sorry for the poor POKéMON.$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerRusellIntro::
	.string "You’re headed to AZALEA, are you?\n"
	.string "Let my POKéMON see if you are good\l"
	.string "enough to battle.$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerRusellDefeat::
	.string "Oh, oh, oh!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_HikerRusell::
	.string "All right, then! I’ve decided.\p"
	.string "I’m not leaving until my POKéMON\n"
	.string "get tougher!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherBillIntro::
	.string "ZUBAT’s SUPERSONIC keeps confusing\n"
	.string "my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I’m seriously upset about that!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherBillDefeat::
	.string "I’m flamed out!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherBill::
	.string "On weekends, you can hear strange\n"
	.string "roars from deep in the cave.$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_PokemaniacLarryIntro::
	.string "I roam far and wide in search of\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Are you looking for POKéMON too?\n"
	.string "Then you’re my collecting rival!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_PokemaniacLarryDefeat::
	.string "Ugh. My poor POKéMON...$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_PokemaniacLarry::
	.string "Every Friday, you can hear POKéMON\n"
	.string "roars from deep inside the cave.$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherRayIntro::
	.string "If it’s light, a cave isn’t scary.\p"
	.string "If you’re strong POKéMON aren’t\n"
	.string "scary.$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherRayDefeat::
	.string "FLASH!$"

UnionCave_Cave1_Text_FirebreatherRay::
	.string "It’s my POKéMON’s fire that lights\n"
	.string "up this cave.$"
